The first 49 [post-run] lines (0233, 08:26-09:10Z): total median 4.5 s,
and one lap, „stored", median 2.1 s on every run, most of the rest. Each lap
is a multiple of about 150 ms, one database round trip. „stored" covers
everything after the moderation verdict: saving the reply, taking out the
steps it repeats, delivering what waits, the close-or-keep card and the
wallet debit. It is now five laps (reply, steps, waiting, card, wallet), so
the fix goes to the step that holds the time. Logging only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
